# Normalise line endings in the repository regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# Development happens on Windows and CI runs on Linux. Without this, every
# commit warns about LF/CRLF conversion and a stray CRLF in a .go file makes
# `gofmt -l` fail in CI for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# SQL and shell scripts are read by containers, where a CR is a syntax error.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
